          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I place an order?",
            "answer": "<p>Browse our collections, choose your piece and select <strong>Add to cart</strong>. When you’re ready, open your cart, select <strong>Check out</strong> and enter your delivery and payment details. You’ll receive an order confirmation by email as soon as your order is placed.</p>"
