          "settings": {
            "title": "PRODUCTS"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials are used?",
            "answer": "<p>Our pieces are made from premium materials with a polished 21K gold-plated finish. Many designs are set with sparkling cubic zirconia stones, pearls or mother-of-pearl — the exact materials are listed in each product’s details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the pieces hypoallergenic?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our jewellery is hypoallergenic and designed to be comfortable for everyday wear, including for sensitive skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I care for my jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>To keep your pieces shining, avoid contact with water, perfume, lotions and household chemicals, and put your jewellery on last when getting ready. Wipe gently with a soft, dry cloth after wearing and store each piece separately in its pouch or box to prevent scratches.</p>"
          }
        },
        "category_4": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "RETURNS"
          }
        },
        "question_10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We want you to love your jewellery. If you’re not completely happy, eligible items can be returned or exchanged in their original, unworn condition with all packaging. Please see our Returns policy for full timeframes and conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_11": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I request a return?",
            "answer": "<p>Contact us with your order number and the item(s) you’d like to return or exchange. Our team will confirm eligibility and send you the next steps.</p>"
          }
        },
        "category_5": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WARRANTY"
          }
        },
        "question_12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does the 1-year warranty cover?",
            "answer": "<p>Every SOLEIL piece comes with a 1-year warranty covering manufacturing defects, such as faulty clasps, settings or plating defects under normal wear. It doesn’t cover damage from accidents, misuse, loss or normal wear and tear.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_13": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I make a warranty claim?",
            "answer": "<p>Contact us with your order number, a short description of the issue and a photo of the piece. Our team will review your claim and arrange a repair or replacement where it’s covered.</p>"
          }
        },
